0..75 Comment "// A lookup under one binder more is the lookup weakened. `look` counts the"
76..147 Comment "// binders it has crossed and weakens what it finds by their number, so"
148..223 Comment "// crossing one more weakens once more; at a consed term the two weakenings"
224..297 Comment "// fuse by `renameRename`, and at a shift the sum is read by `shiftAdds`."
299..375 Comment "// The naturals; the syntax; the shift\'s lookup and the fusion of renamings."
